634	/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ *
635	 * 6. The generated shell is real shell
636	 *
637	 * `srcInventoryScript` assembles ~120 lines of POSIX shell out of a TypeScript
638	 * array, with three nested levels of quoting (TS string → shell double quotes →
639	 * an embedded Go template in single quotes). A quoting mistake there passes
640	 * typecheck, passes build and passes lint, then fails on a customer's live server
641	 * mid-cutover as an EMPTY inventory — which the engine reads as "this machine has
642	 * nothing on it". So the shell is parsed by a real shell here.
643	 * ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
